      "description": {
        "nodeId": "85:1338",
        "left": 850,
        "top": 277,
        "width": 531,
        "height": 272,
        "text": "A visual identity for a retrospective dedicated to filmmaker Gus Van Sant, developed across a poster, folded program, and book cover. Typography plays a central role in the project, using scale, hierarchy, and the relationship between Hebrew and English to create a flexible editorial system. Fragmented imagery and soft photography are integrated into the typographic compositions, reflecting the sense of movement, intimacy, and wandering found throughout Van Sant’s films. The system shifts across formats while maintaining a consistent visual language."
      },
