      "description": {
        "nodeId": "85:1416",
        "left": 855,
        "top": 277,
        "width": 426,
        "height": 272,
        "text": "An AI-generated image series exploring the place of the individual in an increasingly AI-driven world. Created using Midjourney, the project imagines anonymous human figures as identical forms produced on an endless assembly line. Through repetition, uniformity, and a sterile visual language, the series questions what makes us human when individuality begins to disappear. As artificial intelligence becomes capable of generating endless versions of us, the project asks: where does our uniqueness remain?"
      },
