        "height": 254,
        "text": "An album cover design for Israeli musician Dudu Tassa, inspired by the contrast between his Iraqi musical roots and his contemporary rock sound. The design brings these two worlds together through an ethnic-inspired pattern combined with a more technical, digital visual language. The project explores the tension between tradition and modernity, translating Tassa’s musical identity into a visual system that feels rooted in the past while belonging to the present."
